{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 15/05/2024, the proposal as shown on the drawings Location Plan (unnumbered), 01, 02, 03 as submitted on 17/05/2024, was not lawful because:\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class E of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the footprint of the proposed outbuilding, measuring approximately 51.50 square metres, would be comparable to the footprint of the main house at this address. Thus, the outbuilding, by virtue of its size and scale cannot be considered to be incidental to the main house and, furthermore, no justification as to why an outbuilding of this scale is 'reasonably required' for purposes incidental to the occupation of the dwellinghouse has been provided. \r\n"
  ],
